sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as Super Admin
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant BE as FastAPI Backend
    participant DB as MySQL Database
    participant BC as Ethereum (Admin Script)

    Admin->>FE: Input University Details (Name, Email, Wallet)
    FE->>BE: POST /api/issuer/register (Auth: Admin Token)
    BE->>BE: Verify Admin Token
    BE->>DB: Check if Email exists
    
    alt Email Unique
        BE->>DB: Insert into tbl_issuer
        DB-->>BE: id_issuer generated
        
        Note over BE, BC: Automated Blockchain Sync
        BE->>BC: register_issuer_on_blockchain(wallet, univ_id, name)
        BC-->>BE: Transaction Hash
        
        BE-->>FE: 201 Created
        FE-->>Admin: Show Success Notification
    else Email Taken
        BE-->>FE: 400 Bad Request
        FE-->>Admin: Show Error
    end
